    "detailed_description": "Omni Blade is an immersive and tactically challenging retro RPG inspired by classic games such as 7th Saga, Grandia, and Chrono Trigger. It features around 20 hours of gameplay, a thematically dense and dream-like narrative, as well as vibrantly colored pixel art - all brought to life by a beautifully evocative musical score! Omni Blade enhances replayability with procedurally generated levels and teammates that can be recruited in the order of your choosing. Built from the ground-up with a custom engine (Nu Game Engine), Omni Blade isn't your typical cookie-cutter indie RPG. If you're looking for the type of escapism and challenge from the old school era of console RPGs, Omni Blade promises you a captivating experience!",
